msgAqiCycleMenu:
{icoSetByAQI} <b>Set zone boundaries by AQI standard</b>

Configure threshold values for PM2.5 and PM10 at which the bot will generate notifications, copying them from supported AQI standards.

{icoPm25} <b>Current PM2.5 Thresholds</b>
{icoPmLevel1} Green zone upper threshold = {vg1%.1f}
{icoPmLevel2} Yellow zone upper threshold = {vy1%.1f}

{icoPm10} <b>Current PM10 Thresholds</b>
{icoPmLevel1} Green zone upper threshold = {vg2%.1f}
{icoPmLevel2} Yellow zone upper threshold = {vy2%.1f}

